    "description": "● Developed multiple RESTful APIs using C# and Java, enabling seamless communication and integration between various services and\napplications, while ensuring high performance and security standards.\n● Developed customized ERP solutions using web-based applications, focusing on data management and workflow optimization for\ndiverse client needs.\n● Engineered an automated system seamlessly integrated into our ERP, dynamically connecting Shopify with Dynamics 365 (D365) using\nNode.js and GraphQL. This solution streamlined e-commerce operations by ensuring real-time data synchronization, significantly\nreducing manual intervention, and improving operational efficiency.\n● Integrated SAP with Salesforce by developing a system that automates the transfer of data between the two platforms. This solution\nensures that PDFs generated in SAP are automatically uploaded to Salesforce, and any order updates in SAP are instantly reflected in\nSalesforce, streamlining operations and enhancing data accuracy.\n● Leveraged .NET framework to develop and customize SAP solutions, ensuring seamless integration and functionality within ERP\nsystems.\n● Designed and implemented retail/wholesale websites integrated with ERP systems, leveraging HTML, JavaScript, jQuery, and PHP to\nalign with client objectives.\n● Customized user interfaces for ERP systems, employing ExtJS, HTML, and CSS to enhance usability and streamline workflow\nprocesses.\n● Developed and customized functionalities for clients, utilizing Classic ASP, JavaScript, jQuery, and PHP to address unique business\nrequirements and enhance system capabilities.\n● Managed data effectively by writing and optimizing SQL queries, enabling efficient data retrieval and analysis to support informed\ndecision-making",
